:index+1}));\nJS\"","aggregated_output":"{\"title\":\"E.T. the Extra-Trusting\",\"stem\":\"E.T.-the-Extra-Trusting-ET-the-Extra-Terrestrial-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-191342\",\"index\":22}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
