{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'WebGPURenderer|MeshStandardNodeMaterial|MeshBasicNodeMaterial|normalWorld|color' node_modules/three/build/three.webgpu.js | tail -5 && cat vendor/session.js | head -30\"","aggregated_output":"76406: * Note: This type of texture can only be used with `WebGPURenderer`\n76502: * Note: This type of texture can only be used with `WebGPURenderer`\n76582: * Note: This type of buffer attribute can only be used with `WebGPURenderer`\n77058: * Note: `ClippingGroup` can only be used with `WebGPURenderer`.\n77115:export { ACESFilmicToneMapping, AONode, AddEquation, AddOperation, AdditiveBlending, AgXToneMapping, AlphaFormat, AlwaysCompare, AlwaysDepth, AlwaysStencilFunc, AmbientLight, AmbientLightNode, Analyti [... omitted end of long line]\n/*! aihub-session 1.4.0 — AI Hub Session Protocol v1 client. Paste it into your game unmodified. */\n(function (root) {\n  'use strict';\n  if (root.AIHub) return;\n\n  var VERSION = '1.4.0';\n  var HELLO_EVERY_MS = 500;\n  var HELLO_TIMEOUT_MS = 10000;\n  var PROGRESS_EVERY_MS = 1000;\n  /** The hub's welcome may change these; a newer hub never needs a newer copy of this file for it. */\n  var limits = { maxBytes: 16384, ratePerS: 20, burst: 40 };\n\n  var framed = false;\n  try {\n    framed = root.parent && root.parent !== root;\n  } catch (e) {\n    framed = true;\n  }\n  var search = String(root.location && root.location.search);\n  var flagged = /[?&]aihub=/.test(search);\n  var seedArg = /[?&]aihub-seed=(\\d+)/.exec(search);\n\n  var hub = {\n    version: VERSION,\n    protocol: 1,\n    /** True when the hub launched this page for a session (?aihub=1 inside a frame). */\n    active: !!(flagged && framed),\n    me: null,\n    host: null,\n    isHost: false,\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The random draw selected **E.T. the Extra-Trusting**. Its central mechanic is trust: hiding helps your small passenger recover, while his glowing hand can restore plants, distract searchers, and lift the bicycle. I’ve read the Hub protocol and am building a shared world for up to four riders, with a standalone room system too."}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"mkdir -p src tests && cat > PLAN.md <<'EOF'\n# E.T. the Extra-Trusting\n\nAn original affectionate adventure inspired by E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial (1982).\n\n- Elevated third-person bicycle exploration in a hand-built moonlit, ink-outlined suburb and redwood forest.\n- Three salvage pieces, moving searchlight patrols, candy distractions, hush riding, a recovering bond, restorative glow, a living creek bridge, flowers and a three-note transmitter puzzle.\n- Six-ring levitating bicycle escape, landing, a staged farewell and complete ending; checkpoint rescue, saved journey, replay and free ride.\n- Native Three.js AnimationMixer/AnimationClip for rider, bicycle and passenger animation. WebGPU via Three.js r180, Rapier 0.19.3 kinematic collision and dynamic candy, Web Audio synthesis, Gamepad API.\n- Controller-first menus, adaptive PlayStation/Xbox/keyboard hints, mouse world interaction, touch assistance, map, settings, credits, live developer tools from Pause.\n- Ten-second title idle timer starts an autonomous looping tour. Input returns to the menu.\n- AI Hub Session Protocol v1 shared-world authoritative host; standalone BroadcastChannel + PeerJS WebRTC rooms, four seats, no chat.\n- Bundle all runtime libraries and WASM into one portable HTML. No runtime art, sound, fonts or module downloads.\n- One quiet command tests startup, a complete real simulation playthrough, mechanics, inputs, audio, save/settings, standalone multiplayer and the official Hub harness scenarios. Screenshots only for visual review.\nEOF\ncat > build.mjs <<'EOF'\nimport { readFileSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\nimport { spawnSync } from 'node:child_process';\nimport { resolve } from 'node:path';\nconst {stem}=JSON.parse(readFileSync('selection.json','utf8'));\nconst result=spawnSync('bun',['build','src/main.js','--target','browser','--minify','--outfile','bundle.js'],{encoding:'utf8'});\nif(result.status\"'!==0) { console.error(result.stderr);process.exit(1); }\nconst js=readFileSync('\"'bundle.js','utf8').replaceAll('</script','<\\\\\\\\/script');\nconst session=readFileSync('vendor/session.js','utf8');\nlet page=readFileSync('src/page.html','utf8').replace('<\"'!--HUB_CLIENT-->'\"',\"'`<script>${session}</script>`).replace('\"'/*INLINE_CSS*/',readFileSync('src/style.css','utf8')).replace('<\"'!--GAME_SCRIPT-->'\"',\"'`<script type=\"module\">${js}</script>`);\nconst credits=JSON.parse(readFileSync('\"'credits.json','utf8'));page=page.replace('/*CREDITS_DATA*/',JSON.stringify(credits));\nwriteFileSync(resolve('..',stem+'.html'),page);writeFileSync('game.html',page);\nconsole.log('Built '+stem+'.html');\nEOF\ncat > src/page.html <<'EOF'\n<\"'!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<!--HUB_CLIENT-->\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no,viewport-fit=cover\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#101d29\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"1-4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"shared-world\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Together, gather three transmitter parts, call the stars, and guide a little visitor home.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Left stick / WASD: ride. Cross / E: interact. Square / Q: glow. Circle / F: candy. R2 / Space: boost. L2 / Shift: hush. Triangle / Tab: map. Options / Esc: pause.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"12\">\n<meta name=\"hub:webgpu\" content=\"required\">\n<title>E.T. the Extra-Trusting</title>\n<style>/*INLINE_CSS*/</style></head>\n<body data-input=\"keyboard\">\n<canvas id=\"world\" aria-label=\"Moonlit bicycle adventure\"></canvas>\n<div id=\"grain\"></div><div id=\"vignette\"></div><div id=\"flash\"></div>\n<div id=\"loader\"><div class=\"loading-mark\">✦</div><div class=\"eyebrow\">A SMALL SIGNAL IN A VERY BIG SKY</div><h1>One moment, stargazer.</h1><p id=\"loading-note\">Waking the fireflies…</p><div class=\"load-track\"><span></span></div></div>\n<div id=\"title-screen\" class=\"screen hidden\">\n<div class=\"title-shade\"></div><div class=\"title-top\"><span class=\"brand\">MOONLIT STORIES <i>№ 01</i></span><span class=\"edition\">AN INTERACTIVE BICYCLE ADVENTURE</span></div>\n<div class=\"title-content\"><div class=\"eyebrow\"><span class=\"tiny-star\">✦</span> A LITTLE LOST. A LOT LOVED.</div><h1 class=\"game-title\"><span>E.T.</span><small>the Extra-Trusting</small></h1><p class=\"tagline\">The way home begins<br>with a friend.</p><div class=\"menu-stack\" id=\"title-buttons\"><button data-action=\"new\" class=\"primary\">Begin the night <span>↗</span></button><button data-action=\"continue\" id=\"continue-button\" class=\"hidden\">Continue your journey <span>↗</span></button><button data-action=\"coop\">Ride together <em>1–4</em></button><button data-action=\"settings\">Settings</button><button data-action=\"about\">About this little world</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"title-footer\"><span><b>1982, SOMEWHERE IN THE SUBURBS.</b><br>Three spare parts. One impossible ride.</span><span id=\"title-input-note\">WASD to ride · E to lend a hand</span><span class=\"handmade\">A love letter to wonder <i>✧</i></span></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"attract-banner\" class=\"hidden\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">THE NIGHT IS PLAYING ITSELF</span><strong>A small glimpse of a big adventure</strong><span>Press anything to make it yours</span></div>\n<div id=\"hud\" class=\"hidden\"><div class=\"quest-panel\"><div class=\"eyebrow\" id=\"chapter-label\"></div><h2 id=\"quest-title\"></h2><p id=\"quest-detail\"></p><div id=\"part-tokens\"></div></div><div class=\"status-panel\"><div class=\"bond-row\"><span class=\"heart-icon\">♡</span><div><div class=\"meter-label\"><b>TOGETHER</b><span id=\"bond-value\">100</span></div><div class=\"meter\"><i id=\"bond-fill\"></i></div></div></div><div cl