{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_13","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"mkdir -p src tests && cat > PLAN.md <<'EOF'\n# E.T. the Extra-Trusting\n\nAn original affectionate adventure inspired by E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial (1982).\n\n- Elevated third-person bicycle exploration in a hand-built moonlit, ink-outlined suburb and redwood forest.\n- Three salvage pieces, moving searchlight patrols, candy distractions, hush riding, a recovering bond, restorative glow, a living creek bridge, flowers and a three-note transmitter puzzle.\n- Six-ring levitating bicycle escape, landing, a staged farewell and complete ending; checkpoint rescue, saved journey, replay and free ride.\n- Native Three.js AnimationMixer/AnimationClip for rider, bicycle and passenger animation. WebGPU via Three.js r180, Rapier 0.19.3 kinematic collision and dynamic candy, Web Audio synthesis, Gamepad API.\n- Controller-first menus, adaptive PlayStation/Xbox/keyboard hints, mouse world interaction, touch assistance, map, settings, credits, live developer tools from Pause.\n- Ten-second title idle timer starts an autonomous looping tour. Input returns to the menu.\n- AI Hub Session Protocol v1 shared-world authoritative host; standalone BroadcastChannel + PeerJS WebRTC rooms, four seats, no chat.\n- Bundle all runtime libraries and WASM into one portable HTML. No runtime art, sound, fonts or module downloads.\n- One quiet command tests startup, a complete real simulation playthrough, mechanics, inputs, audio, save/settings, standalone multiplayer and the official Hub harness scenarios. Screenshots only for visual review.\nEOF\ncat > build.mjs <<'EOF'\nimport { readFileSync, writeFileSync } from 'node:fs';\nimport { spawnSync } from 'node:child_process';\nimport { resolve } from 'node:path';\nconst {stem}=JSON.parse(readFileSync('selection.json','utf8'));\nconst result=spawnSync('bun',['build','src/main.js','--target','browser','--minify','--outfile','bundle.js'],{encoding:'utf8'});\nif(result.status\"'!==0) { console.error(result.stderr);process.exit(1); }\nconst js=readFileSync('\"'bundle.js','utf8').replaceAll('</script','<\\\\\\\\/script');\nconst session=readFileSync('vendor/session.js','utf8');\nlet page=readFileSync('src/page.html','utf8').replace('<\"'!--HUB_CLIENT-->'\"',\"'`<script>${session}</script>`).replace('\"'/*INLINE_CSS*/',readFileSync('src/style.css','utf8')).replace('<\"'!--GAME_SCRIPT-->'\"',\"'`<script type=\"module\">${js}</script>`);\nconst credits=JSON.parse(readFileSync('\"'credits.json','utf8'));page=page.replace('/*CREDITS_DATA*/',JSON.stringify(credits));\nwriteFileSync(resolve('..',stem+'.html'),page);writeFileSync('game.html',page);\nconsole.log('Built '+stem+'.html');\nEOF\ncat > src/page.html <<'EOF'\n<\"'!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<!--HUB_CLIENT-->\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1,maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=no,viewport-fit=cover\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#101d29\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session\" content=\"1\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-players\" content=\"1-4\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-mode\" content=\"shared-world\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-goal\" content=\"Together, gather three transmitter parts, call the stars, and guide a little visitor home.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-howto\" content=\"Left stick / WASD: ride. Cross / E: interact. Square / Q: glow. Circle / F: candy. R2 / Space: boost. L2 / Shift: hush. Triangle / Tab: map. Options / Esc: pause.\">\n<meta name=\"hub:session-minutes\" content=\"12\">\n<meta name=\"hub:webgpu\" content=\"required\">\n<title>E.T. the Extra-Trusting</title>\n<style>/*INLINE_CSS*/</style></head>\n<body data-input=\"keyboard\">\n<canvas id=\"world\" aria-label=\"Moonlit bicycle adventure\"></canvas>\n<div id=\"grain\"></div><div id=\"vignette\"></div><div id=\"flash\"></div>\n<div id=\"loader\"><div class=\"loading-mark\">✦</div><div class=\"eyebrow\">A SMALL SIGNAL IN A VERY B