{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_53","type":"agent_message","text":"The journey test passes all 44 checks, including the ending and an attract-mode loop that completes the adventure. Visual review caught foreground trees hiding the rider, so I’ve cleared the opening view and added a canopy cutaway around the bicycle. The full suite is now checking menus, controller and touch input, audio, standalone co-op, and the four Hub scenarios."}}
