{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_61","type":"agent_message","text":"The broader tests found two more problems: a quick controller press could arrive before menu focus was set, and Hub copies were waiting for graphics initialization before joining the session. I’ve made focus immediate and moved the Hub greeting ahead of scene construction. I’m checking those fixes and the two-page co-op connection before the final pass."}}
