etwork.mode===\\\\\\\"solo\\\\\\\"',timeout=15000)\\\\n    check('Host leaving preserves the guest checkpoint',guest.evaluate('__game.state.parts[0] && __game.state.bridge'))\\\\n    ctx.close()\\\")\np.write_text(s)\nPY\nnode --check src/network.js\nnode build.mjs\nTMPDIR=. /home/micha/.local/share/pipx/venvs/playwright/bin/python -u tests/run.py --group network --visual\"","aggregated_output":"Built E.T.-the-Extra-Trusting-ET-the-Extra-Terrestrial-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-191342.html\n16 checks · 0 failures\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
