s.length > 6\n) throw new Error('Exit interview shape is invalid.');\nEOF\nbiome check --write build.mjs catalogue.json\nnode build.mjs\"","aggregated_output":"Checked 2 files in 8ms. Fixed 1 file.\nBuilt E.T.-the-Extra-Trusting-ET-the-Extra-Terrestrial-1982-gpt-6.1-sol-max-20261105-191342.html\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
